# The complement of combat-single-block-kills-attacker (attacker bigger,
# not blocker bigger): Hill Giant (3/3) attacks; Silvercoat Lion (2/2)
# blocks. The Giant's 3 damage is lethal to the Lion's 2 toughness; the
# Lion's 2 damage back is short of the Giant's 3, which survives.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance
